PROJECT NOTICE

BlackBar MCP is an AI-assisted media redaction
application designed to run on Databricks Apps.

The project provides tools for detecting and
redacting sensitive information from images,
audio, video and PDF documents stored in
Databricks Unity Catalog Volumes.

